sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 10 5
    participant A as Client
    participant B as Server
    A->B: solid, no head
    A-->B: dotted, no head
    A->>B: solid arrow
    B-->>A: dotted arrow
    A<<->>B: both ways
    A<<-->>B: both ways, dotted
    A-xB: cross
    A--xB: dotted cross
    A-)B: async
    A--)B: dotted async
    B->>B: self call
    autonumber off
    A->>B: unnumbered
    A->>B: I #9829; you#59; #infin; times
